{
  "name": "Modul 6: Tugas 3 - AI Video Generator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Generate Video Konten Otomatis",
        "formDescription": "Isi informasi di bawah ini untuk memulai proses generate video AI dari gambar",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "prompt",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "Contoh: Make a moving video based on the image I sent. I want it to rotate",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "img_url",
              "placeholder": "https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id=xxxx",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "api_key",
              "fieldType": "password",
              "placeholder": "Masukkan API Key Kie AI kamu",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7154a95e-878f-4c26-baf9-af67c185707d",
      "name": "Submit Text Prompt untuk Generate Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -2304,
        416
      ],
      "webhookId": "fa51983b-e2cc-47ed-b353-1f7d09977225",
      "notes": "Langkah 1: Node Form sebagai pemicu awal. Pengguna mengisi prompt, img_url (URL gambar Google Drive format uc?export=download), dan api_key melalui URL form yang digenerate n8n."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.kie.ai/api/v1/jobs/createTask",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.api_key }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"grok-imagine/image-to-video\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"image_urls\": [\n      \"{{$json.img_url}}\"\n    ],\n    \"prompt\": \"{{$json.prompt}}\",\n    \"mode\": \"normal\",\n    \"duration\": \"6\",\n    \"resolution\": \"480p\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d94342d1-1788-40cf-9b66-0d6ef11127a9",
      "name": "Mengirim Video Generation Request ke Kie AI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -2064,
        416
      ],
      "notes": "Langkah 2: HTTP POST ke endpoint https://api.kie.ai/api/v1/jobs/createTask dengan model grok-imagine/image-to-video. Header Authorization menggunakan api_key dari form. Respons berisi taskId untuk polling status."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 20
      },
      "id": "2de9fdbc-3e40-44ea-9c9c-f912ad1a6a3f",
      "name": "Menunggu Proses Generate Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -1824,
        416
      ],
      "webhookId": "wait-20-detik-polling-video",
      "notes": "Langkah 3 (bagian polling loop): Memberikan jeda 20 detik agar server AI memiliki waktu memproses permintaan video sebelum dicek statusnya kembali."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.kie.ai/api/v1/jobs/recordInfo",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "taskId",
              "value": "={{ $('Mengirim Video Generation Request ke Kie AI').item.json.data.taskId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Submit Text Prompt untuk Generate Video').item.json.api_key }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fbb69465-1610-47a2-93d3-c177ec2b614f",
      "name": "Mendapatkan Status Generate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1584,
        416
      ],
      "notes": "Langkah 3 (bagian polling loop): HTTP GET ke endpoint recordInfo untuk mengecek status tugas. taskId diambil dari respons node createTask. api_key diambil dari node form pemicu."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-state-success",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.state }}",
              "rightValue": "success",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b07aecf8-93b1-4047-9d9d-4eac4a3d5971",
      "name": "Check Jika Generate Sudah Selesai",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -1344,
        416
      ],
      "notes": "Langkah 4: Gerbang logika yang memeriksa apakah field 'state' dalam data respons mengandung 'success'. TRUE → lanjut ke ekstraksi URL video. FALSE → kembali ke Wait (polling loop ulang)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse Video URL - Tugas 3 AI Video Generator\n// Mem-parsing field resultJson dari respons API dan mengekstrak URL video\n\nlet resultJson = $json.data.resultJson;\n\n// Jika resultJson berupa string, parse dulu\nif (typeof resultJson === 'string') {\n  resultJson = JSON.parse(resultJson);\n}\n\n// Ekstrak videoUrl dari resultUrls array\nconst videoUrl = resultJson.resultUrls?.[0] || resultJson.videoUrl || null;\n\nif (!videoUrl) {\n  throw new Error('Video URL tidak ditemukan dalam respons. Periksa struktur data: ' + JSON.stringify(resultJson));\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    videoUrl: videoUrl,\n    taskId: $json.data.taskId\n  }\n}];\n"
      },
      "id": "69dbe572-9f0d-4957-999e-419879849db8",
      "name": "Parse Video URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1120,
        288
      ],
      "notes": "Langkah 5: Code Node JavaScript. Mem-parsing field resultJson (bisa berupa string JSON atau objek) dari respons API. Mengekstrak videoUrl dari array resultUrls. Melempar error jika URL tidak ditemukan."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.videoUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "9bae0d8e-b423-458f-8e8d-3e1a2d6e1db8",
      "name": "Download Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -896,
        288
      ],
      "notes": "Langkah 6: HTTP GET untuk mengunduh file video (data biner) dari videoUrl yang diekstrak. Respons dikonfigurasi sebagai File (binary) agar bisa diunggah ke Google Drive."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "=Video_AI_{{ $now.format('yyyyMMdd_HHmmss') }}.mp4",
        "driveId": {
